; AI arena: a symmetric level for AI-vs-AI matches (and the navigation tests).
; Every part is reachable both ways: a mound with one-tile steps in the middle, a deck on each side reached by a ladder.
; Crates: red near each base (zones 1 and 3), blue on top of the mound (zone 2).
; Pads: team 1 at the left, team 2 at the right (4 columns x 2 rows, marker = bottom-left cell).
name=AI Arena
drop.1=red,6,2
drop.2=blue,12,1
drop.3=red,6,2
